{"id":"0cd188309df2aec8","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-gen-hierarchy.md","title":"Generic Hierarchy","display":"df-gen-hierarchy — Generic Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-gen-hierarchy","aliases":["58-df-gen-hierarchy"],"display":"df-gen-hierarchy — Generic Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model]]","[[../batch10/58-df-rank.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-gen-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-gen-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gen-hierarchy — Generic Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03675b0df2f4ca9a\" href=\"?note=03675b0df2f4ca9a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model\">58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"39b5d097687ec105\" href=\"?note=39b5d097687ec105\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-rank.md\">../batch10/58-df-rank.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (ground model), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span> (forcing), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>-generic filter), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> (ordinal), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> (candidate rank stage)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S\\)</span> (generic-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"03675b0df2f4ca9a\" href=\"?note=03675b0df2f4ca9a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model\">58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}\">\\(\\operatorname{rank}\\)</span> (rank function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericHierarchyLevel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericHierarchyLevel}_S\\)</span> (generic hierarchy predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gen-hierarchy} \\vdash \\mathrm{GenericHierarchyLevel}_S(H,M,G,\\mathbb P,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S(G,M,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land H=\\{x\\in M[G]\\mid\\operatorname{rank}(x)&lt;\\alpha\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gen-hierarchy} \\vdash \\mathrm{GenericHierarchyLevel}_S(H,M,G,\\mathbb P,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S(G,M,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land H=\\{x\\in M[G]\\mid\\operatorname{rank}(x)&lt;\\alpha\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> is the actual rank-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> stage computed in the extension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\">\\(M[G]\\)</span>; the former expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(V_\\alpha)^G\">\\((V_\\alpha)^G\\)</span> had no defined forcing interpretation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model","status":"resolved","id":"03675b0df2f4ca9a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-rank.md","status":"resolved","id":"39b5d097687ec105","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-rank.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model","status":"resolved","id":"03675b0df2f4ca9a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S$ (generic-filter predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rank}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenericHierarchyLevel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gen-hierarchy} \\vdash \\mathrm{GenericHierarchyLevel}_S(H,M,G,\\mathbb P,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S(G,M,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land H=\\{x\\in M[G]\\mid\\operatorname{rank}(x)<\\alpha\\}","display":true},{"tex":"H"